    "text": "A horizontal park is in the shape of a triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>. A vertical lamp post <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math> is erected at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is the midpoint of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
