  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given, a horizontal park is in the shape of a triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>. A vertical lamp post <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math> is erected at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is the midpoint of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to</p><p>Now plotting the graph of given value we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0003_37663af01a83.png\" style=\"width: 278px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;{given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>}</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>cot</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>And in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;{given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>&nbsp;}</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
